flowchart LR
  customer[Customer browser]
  orders[Orders API and durable Saga worker]
  orderdb[(Orders PostgreSQL\norders, steps, idempotency, outbox)]
  catalog[Catalog\nactive SKU validation]
  pricing[Pricing\nprice book and coupon holds]
  inventory[Inventory\natomic stock reservations]
  customerSvc[Customer\nprofile and address]
  payments[Payment simulator\nidempotent auth/capture/void/refund]
  fulfillment[Fulfillment simulator\nidempotent shipment schedule]
  config[Configuration\nversioned simulation settings]
  identity[Local Keycloak\ncheckout worker service account]
  outbox[Order outbox\nKafka publication in M06]

  customer -->|customer token, lines, coupon, idempotency key| orders
  orders <-->|owner-scoped reads/writes| orderdb
  orders -->|synchronous profile/address snapshot; no token persisted| customerSvc
  orders -->|active SKU checks| catalog
  orders -->|versioned simulation settings| config
  orders -->|atomic quote, hold, protect, commit/release| pricing
  orders -->|reserve, protect, consume/release| inventory
  orders -->|authorize / capture / status / compensate| payments
  orders -->|schedule after confirmation| fulfillment
  orders -->|client credentials, internal audience only| identity
  identity -.->|narrow internal token| inventory
  identity -.->|narrow internal token| catalog
  identity -.->|narrow internal token| pricing
  identity -.->|narrow internal token| payments
  identity -.->|narrow internal token| fulfillment
  identity -.->|narrow internal token| config
  orderdb -->|same commit as order confirmation| outbox
  orders -->|202 order ID; poll owned state| customer

